COMPLETE API ENDPOINTS SPECIFICATION - USER JOURNEY FLOW
1. LANDING PAGE TO AUTHENTICATION FLOW
1.1 System Health Check (Landing Page)

    Method: GET
    Path: /health
    Description: Initial system connectivity test when landing page loads
    Authentication: None required
    Response: System status and availability

1.2 User Registration (Signup Flow)

    Method: POST
    Path: /auth/register
    Description: New user account creation from signup form
    Request Body:

{
  "email": "string",
  "password": "string",
  "firstName": "string",
  "lastName": "string",
  "role": "user | processing-staff | deputy-director",
  "organization": "string (optional)",
  "department": "string (optional)"
}

    Response: Registration confirmation or validation errors

1.3 User Authentication (Login Flow)

    Method: POST
    Path: /auth/login
    Description: User login from login form
    Request Body:

{
  "email": "string",
  "password": "string"
}

    Response: JWT token and user profile data for dashboard routing

2. USER/CLIENT DASHBOARD ENDPOINTS
2.1 Load User Documents

    Method: GET
    Path: /documents
    Query Parameters: clientName={userEmail} (filtered on backend)
    Description: Retrieve all documents for logged-in client
    Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token>
    Used By: UserDashboard component on mount

2.2 Submit New Document

    Method: POST
    Path: /documents
    Description: Upload new document from DocumentUpload component
    Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token>
    Request Body:

{
  "name": "string",
  "content": "string",
  "clientName": "string",
  "department": "string",
  "priority": "low | medium | high",
  "deadline": "YYYY-MM-DD"
}

2.3 Get Document Status

    Method: GET
    Path: /documents/{documentId}
    Description: Track specific document progress
    Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token>
    Used By: Document tracking in user dashboard

2.4 Get User Notifications

    Method: GET
    Path: /notifications
    Query Parameters: userId={userId}
    Description: Load notifications for document updates
    Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token>

3. PROCESSING STAFF DASHBOARD ENDPOINTS
3.1 Load All Assigned Documents

    Method: GET
    Path: /documents
    Description: Retrieve all documents for processing (filtered by role)
    Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token>
    Used By: ProcessingStaffDashboard component

3.2 Update Document Status

    Method: PUT
    Path: /documents/{documentId}
    Description: Change document status during processing
    Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token>
    Request Body:

{
  "status": "assigned | in-progress | completed",
  "priority": "low | medium | high",
  "content": "string (optional)"
}

3.3 Document Assignment

    Method: POST
    Path: /documents/{documentId}/assign
    Description: Self-assign or reassign documents
    Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token>
    Request Body:

{
  "assignedTo": "string",
  "assignedBy": "string"
}

3.4 Document Editor Operations

    Method: PUT
    Path: /documents/{documentId}/content
    Description: Edit document content in DocumentEditor
    Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token>
    Request Body:

{
  "content": "string",
  "version": "number"
}

3.5 Document Version Management

    Method: GET
    Path: /documents/{documentId}/versions
    Description: Get document version history
    Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token>

3.6 Send Notifications

    Method: POST
    Path: /notifications
    Description: Notify clients of status changes
    Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token>
    Request Body:

{
  "type": "document_processed | document_edited",
  "title": "string",
  "message": "string",
  "documentId": "string",
  "toUser": "string"
}

4. DEPUTY DIRECTOR DASHBOARD ENDPOINTS
4.1 Load Analytics Data

    Method: GET
    Path: /reports/analytics
    Description: Dashboard analytics for overview cards
    Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token>
    Used By: DeputyDirectorDashboard analytics section

4.2 Generate Performance Reports

    Method: GET
    Path: /reports
    Query Parameters: type=processing&dateRange=lastMonth
    Description: Staff performance and processing reports
    Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token>

4.3 Document Categories Overview

    Method: GET
    Path: /documents/categories
    Description: Document counts by status for DocumentCategories
    Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token>
    Used By: DocumentCategories component

4.4 Download Reports

    Method: GET
    Path: /reports/download
    Query Parameters: type=pdf&reportId={id}
    Description: Download generated reports
    Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token>

4.5 User Management

    Method: GET
    Path: /users
    Description: Get all system users for management
    Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token> (Deputy Director only)

4.6 Update User Roles

    Method: PUT
    Path: /users/{userId}/role
    Description: Change user permissions
    Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token> (Deputy Director only)
    Request Body:

{
  "role": "user | processing-staff | deputy-director"
}

5. NOTIFICATION CENTER ENDPOINTS
5.1 Get All Notifications

    Method: GET
    Path: /notifications/{userId}
    Description: Load notification history for NotificationCenter
    Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token>

5.2 Mark Notifications as Read

    Method: PUT
    Path: /notifications/{notificationId}/read
    Description: Update notification read status
    Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token>

5.3 Real-time Notification Stream

    Method: GET (WebSocket upgrade)
    Path: /notifications/stream
    Description: Live notification updates
    Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token>

6. DOCUMENT MANAGEMENT WORKFLOW ENDPOINTS
6.1 Document Lifecycle Management

    Method: POST
    Path: /workflow/{documentId}/advance
    Description: Move document through workflow stages
    Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token>
    Request Body:

{
  "action": "approve | reject | return | complete",
  "comments": "string",
  "nextStage": "string"
}

6.2 Document Download

    Method: GET
    Path: /documents/{documentId}/download
    Query Parameters: format=pdf|docx
    Description: Download processed documents
    Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token>
    Used By: DocumentCategories download buttons

6.3 Document Delete

    Method: DELETE
    Path: /documents/{documentId}
    Description: Remove documents (completed only)
    Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token>
    Used By: DocumentCategories delete functionality

7. SEARCH AND FILTERING ENDPOINTS
7.1 Document Search

    Method: GET
    Path: /documents/search
    Query Parameters: q={searchTerm}&status={status}&department={dept}
    Description: Search documents across all dashboards
    Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token>

7.2 Advanced Filtering

    Method: POST
    Path: /documents/filter
    Description: Complex document filtering
    Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token>
    Request Body:

{
  "filters": {
    "status": "array",
    "priority": "array", 
    "dateRange": "object",
    "department": "array"
  }
}

8. REPORTING AND ANALYTICS ENDPOINTS
8.1 Dashboard Statistics

    Method: GET
    Path: /analytics/dashboard/{userRole}
    Description: Role-specific dashboard metrics
    Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token>

8.2 Processing Analytics

    Method: GET
    Path: /analytics/processing
    Query Parameters: period=week|month|quarter
    Description: Processing time and efficiency metrics
    Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token>

8.3 Custom Report Generation

    Method: POST
    Path: /reports/generate
    Description: Create custom reports with parameters
    Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token>
    Request Body:

{
  "reportType": "string",
  "parameters": "object",
  "format": "pdf | excel | json"
}

9. SYSTEM ADMINISTRATION ENDPOINTS
9.1 System Configuration

    Method: GET
    Path: /admin/config
    Description: Get system settings
    Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token> (Admin only)

9.2 Audit Logs

    Method: GET
    Path: /admin/audit
    Query Parameters: startDate={date}&endDate={date}
    Description: System activity audit trail
    Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token> (Admin only)

9.3 Free Tier Monitoring

    Method: GET
    Path: /admin/usage
    Description: AWS free tier usage monitoring
    Headers: Authorization: Bearer <token> (Admin only)

10. ERROR HANDLING AND LOGGING
10.1 Error Reporting

    Method: POST
    Path: /errors/report
    Description: Client-side error reporting
    Request Body:

{
  "error": "string",
  "stack": "string",
  "userAgent": "string",
  "url": "string"
}

10.2 Performance Metrics

    Method: POST
    Path: /metrics/performance
    Description: Client performance monitoring
    Request Body:

{
  "page": "string",
  "loadTime": "number",
  "userRole": "string"
}

11. USER JOURNEY ENDPOINT FLOW SUMMARY

Landing Page → Registration/Login: /health → /auth/register OR /auth/login

User Dashboard Flow: /auth/login → /documents → /notifications → /documents/{id}

Processing Staff Flow: /auth/login → /documents → /documents/{id} → /documents/{id}/content → /notifications

Deputy Director Flow: /auth/login → /reports/analytics → /documents/categories → /users → /reports/generate

Document Lifecycle: /documents (POST) → /workflow/{id}/advance → /notifications → /documents/{id}/download